<title>USA: Cross Timbers common tendered.</title>
<headline>Cross Timbers common tendered.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross Timbers Oil Co said Tuesday a preliminary count shows 1,323,211 shares of its common were tendered in response to the company's offer to exchange new series A convertible preferred for up to 2,750,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The offer expired Monday, Cross Timbers noted.</p>
<p>It said 1,137,961 series A shares were exchanged for the tendered common.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
